```rust
struct TerrainData {
    inner: array<u32>,
};
@group(1) @binding(2) var<storage, read> b_Terrain: TerrainData;
```

**Repro steps**
TODO

**Expected vs observed behavior**
Clearly describe what you get, and how it goes across your expectations.

